{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_19","type":"agent_message","text":"The revisions now cover all findings and add the missing acceptance scenarios. Two edge cases needed explicit decisions: valid-Base64 legacy strings must fail later profile/address checks, and a nonempty file with no valid first frame must be rejected without truncation. I’m checking the revised contract for contradictions."}}
